# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment template. Copy this file, rename it to .env, and fill in the values.
#
#   Windows (PowerShell):  Copy-Item .env.example .env
#   Git Bash / macOS / Linux:  cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored: never commit real keys. This template is safe to commit.
# No quotes and no spaces around "=".
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Angel One SmartAPI (required) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# API key: smartapi.angelone.in → My Profile → My Apps → your app → API Key
# Orders via the API also need this PC's public IP registered as the app's
# Primary Static IP (otherwise error AG7002). Data, alerts and the journal work without it.
ANGEL_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Your Angel One login / client ID (e.g. A1234567)
ANGEL_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here

# Your Angel One login MPIN / password
ANGEL_PASSWORD=your_mpin_here

# TOTP secret (the base32 text shown when you enable TOTP, NOT the 6-digit code)
# smartapi.angelone.in/enable-totp → copy the key under the QR code
ANGEL_TOTP_KEY=your_totp_secret_here

# ── Gemini AI (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Free key: aistudio.google.com → Get API key
# Leave as-is to skip auto AI analysis (manual Claude.ai mode is used instead)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
